agreement with the Chapter 5 backtest: max |diff| 4.273e-03 (90.52% of the mean absolute forecast)
   [Gibbs models share a fixed seed and should agree essentially
    exactly; NUTS models re-run a single chain and will differ by
    sampling noise, which is the same magnitude as the seed-to-seed
    variation already documented in Section 4.4.]

